# TPV with EVERY coefficient PVi_0..PVi_39 non-zero on BOTH axes
# (synthetic, gen_highorder_cases.py): degree 0-7 polynomial terms and
# the radial r, r^3, r^5, r^7 terms. Slot m of degree d gets
# s_m * 1.37 / 2048^d (px; TPV acts on PC*(p - CRPIX) before CDELT),
# s_m = +-(1 + 0.13 (m mod 7)), except PVi_1 = 1 + 1e-3 s_1. At the chip
# edge (|eta| ~ 0.15 deg, |xi| ~ 0.075 deg) a term is up to ~0.7 arcsec,
# so a degree-6/7 slot with the wrong xi/eta powers is visible.
# PC + CDELT form (the polynomial applies before CDELT, as in wcslib).
# TOL_PX: see gen_highorder_cases.py.
TOL_PX 1e-8
NOTE pipeline: TPV every PVi_0..PVi_39 on both axes (PC + CDELT)
GRID 1 2048 9 1 4096 9
PIX 1024.5 2048.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 2048
NAXIS2  = 4096
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TPV'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TPV'
CRVAL1  = 35.5
CRVAL2  = -4.75
CRPIX1  = 1024.5
CRPIX2  = 2048.5
CDELT1  = 7.3E-05
CDELT2  = 7.3E-05
PC1_1   = 0.99999
PC1_2   = 1.5E-03
PC2_1   = -1.6E-03
PC2_2   = 0.99998
PV1_0   = -1.370000E+00
PV1_1   = 1.001130E+00
